            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo nyaka nikune ŋatariek? Nikune jondiko? Nikune jopiem ma joriek ma pama? Kole Were otieko nyutho ni rieko ma piny ka meno miŋo ayin!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole Were i rieko pere omito ni ji kiri jowoŋey go gi rieko pajo wegi. Kucel Were oridho botho joma yeyo, gi mikwenda ma wafonjo ma wiŋoyo ni miŋo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Joyuda joyenyo gir'aura paka gir'anena, aka Jogris jodwaro rieko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To wan, watito Kristo m'ogur kwoŋ musalaba, mikwenda m'obedo yet ri Joyuda kodi miŋo ri Jopath, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to ri jom'olwoŋ i dier Joyuda gi Jogris, obedo Kristo m'obedo meni pa Were gi rieko pa Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kole gima cale p'obedo miŋo pa Were fodi riek loyo rieko pa ji. Aka gima cale p'obedo nyapo pa Were nitie gi meni loyo meni pa ji.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Onyo poyi win paka oyido winitie munyo Were olwoŋo win. Joma nok kwoŋ win ama di piny oneno paka jomariek, kosa joma nigi meni, kosa joma nigi dwoŋ i neno pa dhano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "To Were otimo atoŋa yero gima piny ŋisa ni gimiŋo ŋey wokwoti gine wiy jomariek, kodi gima piny tero paka nyap wokwoti gine wiy jomeni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were Oyero gima piny ŋisa aka cayo, aka paro ni meno ki gimoro, ŋey wonyeki woko gima piny paro nike gimadwoŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Meno aka wongoye dhano manyalo pakirok ruwaŋ Were. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Were am'okelo win i riwirok gi Kristo Yesu, to loko Kristo bedo rieko mawan, tiro mawan gi leŋo mawan, kodi cul mareco mawan to walimo siem. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CO 1:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.9.23"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 9:23",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Am'omiyo, ndiko waco ni, “Ŋata mito pakirok wopakere i Rwoth.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CO.1.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CO.1.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
